  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>샘플 사진을 프린트해서 주면,</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">훨씬 더 실험이 잘 진행되더라구요.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">필요하신 분 계실까 사진을 올려봅니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">전구의 밝기 변화</span></b>와</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">전류계, 전압계 눈금 변화</span></b>도 볼 수도 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">글 아래 원본파일도 올립니다. (총 23장)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/414d34ee3f1c021a05a961f736d02e6e23cd9d61\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/414d34ee3f1c021a05a961f736d02e6e23cd9d61\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf013cbdb7206dfe9981bae06ac62807398725b2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf013cbdb7206dfe9981bae06ac62807398725b2\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc92b0424c3ca837e72fc2d158f27692f6188722\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc92b0424c3ca837e72fc2d158f27692f6188722\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dc5990d5b3c1329213d683b02e41a8d571da9cf8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"ht